{"id":"012e08618aea2399","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-cor-density.md","title":"Density Corollary","display":"cor-density — Density Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-density","aliases":["58-cor-density"],"display":"cor-density — Density Corollary","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-density — Density Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,D\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,D\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\left[\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land D\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\delta\\in D\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\delta)\\right]\\to |D|=\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\left[\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land D\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\delta\\in D\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\delta)\\right]\\to |D|=\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every cofinal subset of a regular infinite cardinal has full cardinality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[58-df-cofinality]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\left[\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land D\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\delta\\in D\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\delta)\\right]\\to |D|=\\kappa","display":true}],"bytes":915,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-cor-density.md|58-cor-density]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}